      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        -320
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "**Agen Admin Catering** (id `dapurmbg`) — grup WhatsApp \"Makan Makan Sehat\".\nMencatat file (RC 0, PAGU jadi) dan teks di `dm_inbox`, membalas pendek \"File diterima\". Pekerjaan Google (master harga, PDF PAGU) dijalankan lewat sesi Claude dengan skill DAPUR MBG, hasilnya dikirim kembali ke grup lewat `wa_outbox`.\nNama tampil bisa diubah dari dashboard; id teknis tetap `dapurmbg`.",
        "width": 620,
        "height": 190,
        "color": 4
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "fa06e5eb-cb4d-5ea1-b2d6-26b0c8979fc9",
      "name": "Webhook agen",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "agent-dapurmbg",
        "responseMode": "onReceived",
        "options": {}
      },
      "webhookId": "93e0fc4c-3abf-5292-8e30-dfdf97b09aa2"
    },
    {
      "id": "055f716e-c91f-5f44-99c1-f9bd68e4a4bf",
      "name": "Status: kerja",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        240,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "http://n8n:5678/webhook/lib-set-status",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ agent_id: 'dapurmbg', status: 'working', detail: 'Mencatat pesan grup', task_id: $json.body.task_id }) }}",
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "3b55f893-63cf-5f30-8f33-d674482c3e37",
      "name": "Siapkan",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        480,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Ambil pesan dari payload agen dan bentuk parameter untuk dm_record.\n// Isi file (base64) tidak disimpan di database; hanya file tabel diunggah ke Drive (maks sekitar 8 MB).\nconst p = $('Webhook agen').first().json.body;\nconst MAX_B64 = 11 * 1024 * 1024;\nconst mime = p.mimetype || '';\nconst isDoc = /^document/i.test(p.message_type || '') ||\n  /(spreadsheet|excel|csv|pdf|msword|officedocument)/i.test(mime);\n// Hanya file tabel (xlsx/xls/csv) yang diunggah ke folder \"RC 0\"; PDF dan lainnya hanya dicatat.\nconst isSheet = /(spreadsheet|excel|csv)/i.test(mime);\nconst b64 = isSheet ? (p.media_base64 || null) : null;\nconst tooBig = !!(b64 && b64.length > MAX_B64);\nconst ext = /csv/i.test(mime) ? 'csv' : (/spreadsheetml|openxml/i.test(mime) ? 'xlsx' : 'xls');\n// Nama file tidak dibawa WhatsApp ke sini: pakai keterangan (caption) + waktu WIB.\nconst wib = new Date(Date.now() + 7 * 3600 * 1000).toISOString().slice(0, 16).replace('T', ' ').replace(':', '');\nconst cap = String(p.raw_text ?? p.text ?? '').replace(/[^A-Za-z0-9 _.-]/g, '').trim().slice(0, 40);\nconst fileName = ('RC0 ' + (cap ? cap + ' ' : '') + wib + '.' + ext);\nreturn [{ json: {\n  task_id: p.task_id, chat_id: p.chat_id, too_big: tooBig,\n  upload: !!b64 && !tooBig, b64: tooBig ? null : b64, file_name: fileName, mime,\n  p: {\n    message_id: p.message_id, chat_id: p.chat_id, sender: p.sender, push_name: p.push_name,\n    text: p.raw_text ?? p.text ?? '', message_type: p.message_type, mimetype: p.mimetype,\n  },\n} }];\n"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "59939680-b58a-58b3-b7ce-9498c74d60c5",
      "name": "Catat (RPC dm_record)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        720,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $env.SUPABASE_URL }}/rest/v1/rpc/dm_record",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ p: $json.p }) }}",
        "options": {},
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "specifyHeaders": "json",
        "jsonHeaders": "={{ JSON.stringify($env.SUPABASE_SERVICE_KEY.startsWith('eyJ') ? { apikey: $env.SUPABASE_SERVICE_KEY, Authorization: 'Bearer ' + $env.SUPABASE_SERVICE_KEY } : { apikey: $env.SUPABASE_SERVICE_KEY }) }}"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "e1754a3b-06c2-56c0-bd62-7bafafd0459e",
      "name": "Ada file untuk Drive?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        960,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "0d84f100-893f-5cc8-a199-ec379fc4a123",
              "leftValue": "={{ $('Siapkan').first().json.upload }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "34f93a44-4c30-5f25-9501-9956d92ada86",
      "name": "Siapkan biner",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1200,
        -120
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Ubah base64 dari WhatsApp menjadi file biner untuk node Google Drive.\nconst s = $('Siapkan').first().json;\nconst buf = Buffer.from(s.b64, 'base64');\nconst bin = await this.helpers.prepareBinaryData(buf, s.file_name, s.mime);\nreturn [{ json: { file_name: s.file_name }, binary: { data: bin } }];\n"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cbf94b56-cbc5-5f64-8364-b6a9f1302c3b",
      "name": "Unggah ke Drive",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleDrive",
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "position": [
        1440,
        -120
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "authentication": "serviceAccount",
        "resource": "file",
